/T (Elizabeth Osta Co-Founder & Co-Director, Frugal AI Hub | Visiting Fellow, Cambridge Judge Business School Elizabeth is a digital and data strategist and advisor working with boards and CXOs on  innovation, data and AI strategy and digital transformation. As Co-Director of the Frugal AI Hub and founder of Digital Forward, she focuses on advancing inclusive and sustainable AI practices across sectors. Previously, Elizabeth served as Chief Data Officer at HEINEKEN, leading data transformation across 80 countries. She has held leadership roles at Barclays, dunnhumby, Gillette, McKinsey, and Social Finance, where she explored the use of data to support vulnerable populations. Elizabeth also serves as a non-executive advisor to several fintech startups and is a Visiting Fellow at Cambridge Judge Business School.)
/E (Elizabeth Osta Co-Founder & Co-Director, Frugal AI Hub | Visiting Fellow, Cambridge Judge Business School Elizabeth is a digital and data strategist and advisor working with boards and CXOs on  innovation, data and AI strategy and digital transformation. As Co-Director of the Frugal AI Hub and founder of Digital Forward, she focuses on advancing inclusive and sustainable AI practices across sectors. Previously, Elizabeth served as Chief Data Officer at HEINEKEN, leading data transformation across 80 countries. She has held leadership roles at Barclays, dunnhumby, Gillette, McKinsey, and Social Finance, where she explored the use of data to support vulnerable populations. Elizabeth also serves as a non-executive advisor to several fintech startups and is a Visiting Fellow at Cambridge Judge Business School.)
