/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Through comparative analysis, security mapping, and examples from emerging startups, the paper demonstrates how frugal design principles can make advanced AI accessible by extending innovation to small enterprises, public institutions, and developing regions. Together, the technical and socio-economic frameworks illustrate how Frugal AI can drive inclusive economic growth while accelerating sustainability goals. By aligning cost efficiency with societal value, the Frugal AI framework redefines scalability for the next decade: enabling systems that are not only intelligent but also affordable, sustainable, and inclusive by design.)
/E (Through comparative analysis, security mapping, and examples from emerging startups, the paper demonstrates how frugal design principles can make advanced AI accessible by extending innovation to small enterprises, public institutions, and developing regions. Together, the technical and socio-economic frameworks illustrate how Frugal AI can drive inclusive economic growth while accelerating sustainability goals. By aligning cost efficiency with societal value, the Frugal AI framework redefines scalability for the next decade: enabling systems that are not only intelligent but also affordable, sustainable, and inclusive by design.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
