/T (Efficiency gains can also originate upstream. For e.g., DeepSeek-OCR reduces token volume per inference by approximately 90% \(10x compression\) while maintaining ~97% output fidelity \(Wei, Sun & Li, 2024\). This reduces compute time and API-token expenditure substantially, particularly in long-context or document-heavy workloads. Combined with pruning, quantization, and distillation, such multimodal compression further enhances overall Frugal AI efficiency.)
