/S /H2
/T (The Frugal AI stack, which includes data compression, efficient model architectures, diverse compute hardware, decentralised orchestration, and open standards, brings significant advantages but also introduces specific security risks at every layer. As companies pursue cost and energy efficiency, robust and layered security must not be compromised \(UK Government, 2025; NeuralTrust, 2025; Trend Micro, 2025\).)
/E (The Frugal AI stack, which includes data compression, efficient model architectures, diverse compute hardware, decentralised orchestration, and open standards, brings significant advantages but also introduces specific security risks at every layer. As companies pursue cost and energy efficiency, robust and layered security must not be compromised \(UK Government, 2025; NeuralTrust, 2025; Trend Micro, 2025\).)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [2]
>>
