/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Data and Input Layer: Advancing Collective Data Stewardship Democratised data access is fundamental to Frugal AI. Community-led data cooperatives provide mechanisms for local groups to manage, share, and benefit from data in transparent and ethical ways \(Stein et al., 2023\). In addition, open data exchanges supply accessible platforms for small and medium-sized enterprises, researchers, and local authorities, lowering entry barriers and supporting innovation \(Escudero-Cipriani et al., 2024\).)
/E (Data and Input Layer: Advancing Collective Data Stewardship Democratised data access is fundamental to Frugal AI. Community-led data cooperatives provide mechanisms for local groups to manage, share, and benefit from data in transparent and ethical ways \(Stein et al., 2023\). In addition, open data exchanges supply accessible platforms for small and medium-sized enterprises, researchers, and local authorities, lowering entry barriers and supporting innovation \(Escudero-Cipriani et al., 2024\).)
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
