<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Model Layer: Fostering Local Skills and Knowledge Sharing Regional model libraries, which house lightweight and context-specific models, enhance local relevance and cost efficiency \(Saleem, 2024\). Opportunities for equitable training in model compression, pruning, and federated learning, along with collaborative research between public, private, and community actors, are essential for building capacity \(Govindan, 2024; Qin, 2024\).)
/E (Model Layer: Fostering Local Skills and Knowledge Sharing Regional model libraries, which house lightweight and context-specific models, enhance local relevance and cost efficiency \(Saleem, 2024\). Opportunities for equitable training in model compression, pruning, and federated learning, along with collaborative research between public, private, and community actors, are essential for building capacity \(Govindan, 2024; Qin, 2024\).)
