/T (Compute Layer: Scaling Infrastructure for Inclusion and Sustainability Shared compute pools alongside widespread adoption of edge-first approaches reduce infrastructure costs. This enables rural and resource-constrained communities to participate in the AI economy \(Latent AI, 2025\). The use of open-source hardware and targeted green incentives further promotes accessibility, energy efficiency, and resilient local supply chains \(Gao et al., 2025; PwC, 2025\).)
/E (Compute Layer: Scaling Infrastructure for Inclusion and Sustainability Shared compute pools alongside widespread adoption of edge-first approaches reduce infrastructure costs. This enables rural and resource-constrained communities to participate in the AI economy \(Latent AI, 2025\). The use of open-source hardware and targeted green incentives further promotes accessibility, energy efficiency, and resilient local supply chains \(Gao et al., 2025; PwC, 2025\).)
