/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Frugal AI places sustainability at the forefront of AI system design, prioritising efficiency in computation, energy, and data usage throughout the AI lifecycle. With digital technologies collectively responsible for around 4% of global greenhouse gas emissions, a figure projected to double by 2030, energy-efficient AI adoption has become imperative for both economic and environmental reasons \(Jacquet, 2025; Orange Business, 2025; IEA, 2024\).)
/E (Frugal AI places sustainability at the forefront of AI system design, prioritising efficiency in computation, energy, and data usage throughout the AI lifecycle. With digital technologies collectively responsible for around 4% of global greenhouse gas emissions, a figure projected to double by 2030, energy-efficient AI adoption has become imperative for both economic and environmental reasons \(Jacquet, 2025; Orange Business, 2025; IEA, 2024\).)
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [2]
>>
