/E (Furthermore, national and regional policy frameworks, such as the UK's AI Energy Council and the European Union's AI Act, now put sustainability front and centre, shaping future investment and reporting on AI energy efficacy \(EcoSkills Academy, 2025; IET, 2025\). As AI becomes integral in supporting UN Sustainable Development Goals, its ongoing progress is increasingly measured by its capacity to drive equitable, climate-conscious growth \(EY, 2024; UNDP, 2025\).)
