/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (As the global AI sector enters a pivotal juncture, the imperative to reconcile innovation with sustainable, inclusive economic models has never been more pronounced. This white paper has articulated a compelling vision for a Frugal AI ecosystem, one that consciously aligns technical prowess with resource efficiency, robust governance, and equitable benefits.)
/E (As the global AI sector enters a pivotal juncture, the imperative to reconcile innovation with sustainable, inclusive economic models has never been more pronounced. This white paper has articulated a compelling vision for a Frugal AI ecosystem, one that consciously aligns technical prowess with resource efficiency, robust governance, and equitable benefits.)
/Pg 44 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
501 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (The analysis underscores an undeniable reality: while AI technologies are rapidly advancing, the economic and environmental costs of widespread adoption pose significant challenges, particularly for startups and emerging economies. The Frugal AI framework proposed here addresses these challenges methodically, marrying state-of-the-art compression techniques, modular hardware deployment, and distributed orchestration with principles of transparency, social justice, and sustainability.)
/E (The analysis underscores an undeniable reality: while AI technologies are rapidly advancing, the economic and environmental costs of widespread adoption pose significant challenges, particularly for startups and emerging economies. The Frugal AI framework proposed here addresses these challenges methodically, marrying state-of-the-art compression techniques, modular hardware deployment, and distributed orchestration with principles of transparency, social justice, and sustainability.)
/Pg 44 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
502 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Empirical evidence demonstrates that frugal approaches, spanning model optimisation, energy-aware computing, and upstream data compression, can deliver reductions in both capital and operational expenditure of up to 80%. Such efficiency gains are not merely theoretical; they are being realised through innovative startups, open hardware initiatives, and edge-first deployment strategies, which collectively democratise access to advanced AI capabilities. By shifting away from monolithic, hyperscale architectures and embracing modular, community-driven solutions, the Frugal AI ecosystem extends the benefits of machine intelligence to small enterprises, public institutions, and underserved communities worldwide.)
/E (Empirical evidence demonstrates that frugal approaches, spanning model optimisation, energy-aware computing, and upstream data compression, can deliver reductions in both capital and operational expenditure of up to 80%. Such efficiency gains are not merely theoretical; they are being realised through innovative startups, open hardware initiatives, and edge-first deployment strategies, which collectively democratise access to advanced AI capabilities. By shifting away from monolithic, hyperscale architectures and embracing modular, community-driven solutions, the Frugal AI ecosystem extends the benefits of machine intelligence to small enterprises, public institutions, and underserved communities worldwide.)
/Pg 44 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
503 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Moreover, the proposed socio-economic stack ensures that technical progress does not outpace societal preparedness.By embedding inclusion, regional skill development, open standards, and continuous environmental reporting into every layer of AI deployment, this framework mitigates the risks of exclusion, unchecked resource consumption, and regulatory inertia. It establishes a blueprint for responsible innovation where efficiency gains are matched with robust digital safeguards and collective value creation.)
/E (Moreover, the proposed socio-economic stack ensures that technical progress does not outpace societal preparedness.By embedding inclusion, regional skill development, open standards, and continuous environmental reporting into every layer of AI deployment, this framework mitigates the risks of exclusion, unchecked resource consumption, and regulatory inertia. It establishes a blueprint for responsible innovation where efficiency gains are matched with robust digital safeguards and collective value creation.)
