/S /H1
/T (The journey towards a holistic Frugal AI ecosystem is ongoing. Further research is needed to accurately measure the results in terms of energy savings and cost savings, to further assess risk exposure, and to continuously scan the market for new ideas. We are sure that many more startups or ideas are out there, and we aim at creating a focal point for awareness, idea exchange, and experimentation. Above all, this evolution demands a collaborative spirit, across governments, industry, academia, and civil society, to shape innovation that is not only intelligent but profoundly sustainable and universally accessible.)
/E (The journey towards a holistic Frugal AI ecosystem is ongoing. Further research is needed to accurately measure the results in terms of energy savings and cost savings, to further assess risk exposure, and to continuously scan the market for new ideas. We are sure that many more startups or ideas are out there, and we aim at creating a focal point for awareness, idea exchange, and experimentation. Above all, this evolution demands a collaborative spirit, across governments, industry, academia, and civil society, to shape innovation that is not only intelligent but profoundly sustainable and universally accessible.)
